{
  "dataset": "localStorage (acuting-clinical-cases-v1) -> data/clinical_cases/schema.sql field mapping",
  "status": "design_only__migration_script_NOT_implemented",
  "created": "2026-08-06",
  "policy": [
    "This file is a DESIGN, not a migration. No script reads it yet. It exists so the mapping is reviewable before it is executable — the H2 migration is a one-shot over real clinical data (D12), and a mapping decided inside a script is a mapping nobody reviewed.",
    "Entries with status unresolved_needs_ting MUST NOT be resolved by a migration author. Each one destroys or fabricates clinical meaning, and Ting rejected the obvious merge for all three in 2026-08.",
    "no_destination_yet means the field has real clinical value but no column. It is NOT the same as intentionally_not_migrated, and a migration must fail loudly rather than drop these.",
    "Regenerate rather than hand-edit: this file is emitted from app.js's normalizers and validated against schema.sql, so a destination column that does not exist cannot be written into it.",
    "Language slots: the app stores single-language free text while the schema has _zh/_en pairs. Everything lands in the _zh slot with _en NULL. That is a labelling assumption, not a translation — flagged as low risk on each affected row."
  ],
  "generated_from": {
    "source_of_truth_fields": "app.js — normalizeClinicalCase() and normalizeSoapNote()",
    "destination_schema": "data/clinical_cases/schema.sql",
    "validation": "every destination table.column is asserted to exist in schema.sql before this file is written"
  },
